	 * The header format (RFC 8752) is:
	 *   Next Header (1 byte) - already verified as 43
	 *   Header Length (1 byte) - in units of 8 octets minus 8
	 *   Enabled (1 byte)
	 *   Pending (1 byte)
	 *   Reserved (1 byte)
