/* MPLS header definition.
 * The first 32-bit word (entry) contains:
 *   - Topmost label: 20 bits (bits 20-1)
 *   - Experimental (QoS) bits: 3 bits (bits 2-0)
 *   - Bottom of Stack: 1 bit (bit 0)
 */
